  "sentences": [
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_1",
      "text": "很多年轻人觉得，自己身体很好，不用去运动。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4920,
      "durationMs": 4920,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_2",
      "text": "但是，随着年纪越来越大，身体会发生很多变化。",
      "startMs": 4920,
      "endMs": 10760,
      "durationMs": 5840,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_3",
      "text": "这时候，你才会发现运动有多么重要。",
      "startMs": 10760,
      "endMs": 16720,
      "durationMs": 5960,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_4",
      "text": "运动是一辈子的事。",
      "startMs": 16720,
      "endMs": 19240,
      "durationMs": 2520,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_5",
      "text": "不管是年轻人，还是年纪大的人，每个人都可以运动。",
      "startMs": 19240,
      "endMs": 25760,
      "durationMs": 6520,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_6",
      "text": "只不过，年轻的时候，可以选择很累的运动；年纪大了以后，要选择适合自己的运动，比如走路、游泳或者打太极拳。",
      "startMs": 25760,
      "endMs": 41120,
      "durationMs": 15360,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_7",
      "text": "要保持运动的习惯，不能只在高兴的时候才运动。",
      "startMs": 41120,
      "endMs": 46880,
      "durationMs": 5760,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_8",
      "text": "只要你每天都坚持，你的精神就会越来越好，也不容易生病。",
      "startMs": 46880,
      "endMs": 54320,
      "durationMs": 7440,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_9",
      "text": "所以，不要等到身体不好了才去运动。",
      "startMs": 54320,
      "endMs": 59120,
      "durationMs": 4800,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_10",
      "text": "从今天开始，把运动变成生活的一部分。",
      "startMs": 59120,
      "endMs": 64880,
      "durationMs": 5760,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp9_11",
      "text": "只要你保持运动的习惯，你就一定会有一辈子的健康。",
      "startMs": 64880,
      "endMs": 70960,
      "durationMs": 6080,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p9_sp9_11.mp3"
    }
  ]
}